Refactor proposal:

```ts
// src/sanitize.ts
export function sanitizeText(
  value: string | null | undefined,
): string;
```

This function should contain the complete shared behavior: trimming, control-character removal, whitespace normalization, 1,000-character truncation, rejection checks, punctuation limits, and uppercase normalization. No configuration object is needed because the implementations have no behavioral differences.

